","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T08:18:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T08:20:12Z","body":"Hey there! Just been reading the docs & here it says: \nForward+ renderer: Integrated graphics with full Vulkan 1.0 support, Metal 3 support (macOS) or Direct3D 12 (12_0 feature level) support (Windows)\n\nExample: Intel HD Graphics 5500 (Broadwell), AMD Radeon R5 Graphics (Kaveri)\n[Docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/about/system_requirements.html#id1)\nCan you explain why my GPU isn't supported if you have mentioned this here yourself?\nEDIT: I found out it's for Linux, but please update the docs with this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3131222246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3131265665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109071#issuecomment-3131265665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109071","id":3131265665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66o1KB","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_